===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A [[motion picture]] that generates relatively low [[revenue]] at the [[box office]], especially less than the budget for producing it.
#: ''My favorite movie was a giant '''box-office bomb'''.''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|flop}}
* {{l|en|turkey}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|blockbuster}}

